1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Fifteenth Episode
The Fox's Tale

15
00:02:25,021 --> 00:02:26,818
What are these horns?

16
00:03:05,021 --> 00:03:06,898
A wild boar!

17
00:03:53,341 --> 00:03:57,016
A fox proverb says that
where there is man, there is food.

18
00:03:57,061 --> 00:04:00,497
It's dangerous, I know, but I want
to go look for food.

19
00:04:06,541 --> 00:04:09,931
I haven't met Zul yet in the
fox hunt, this year.

20
00:04:09,981 --> 00:04:12,779
Just as well, Your Majesty,
because that fox is so clever

21
00:04:12,821 --> 00:04:15,335
...that it always causes us
an endless amount of trouble.

22
00:04:16,101 --> 00:04:19,377
People say that it can speak and
that it is more intelligent than man.

23
00:04:19,421 --> 00:04:21,332
It is a very cunning fox

24
00:04:21,381 --> 00:04:24,100
Exactly, Your Majesty!
It understands the speech of men

25
00:04:24,141 --> 00:04:26,655
...and all of their intentions,
so it manages to anticipate...

26
00:04:26,701 --> 00:04:28,692
...every move aimed at capturing it.
It is an extraordinary animal.

27
00:04:31,101 --> 00:04:34,616
I hope to succeed in catching it.
It would be a magnificent trophy.

28
00:04:34,741 --> 00:04:37,016
Yes, its fur is beautiful

29
00:04:37,061 --> 00:04:40,019
It would be an excellent ornament
for Her Majesty the Queen.

30
00:04:40,221 --> 00:04:42,894
Who knows where it might be hiding
at this moment...!

31
00:04:44,501 --> 00:04:48,210
Idiot dog! What are you doing here?
Go hunt with the others!

32
00:04:51,581 --> 00:04:54,459
That animal has been bitten
by some beast.

33
00:04:54,621 --> 00:04:56,816
Animals heal quickly

34
00:05:14,141 --> 00:05:16,097
Sabotage!
Someone has sabotaged us!

35
00:05:16,141 --> 00:05:18,257
They broke
all the water jars!

36
00:05:18,301 --> 00:05:20,496
What will we do now without water?

37
00:05:20,541 --> 00:05:22,771
They put sand in its place!

38
00:05:23,901 --> 00:05:26,176
And a frog in this pan!

39
00:05:26,221 --> 00:05:28,610
Well, at least the meat was saved!

40
00:05:28,661 --> 00:05:31,016
No! They stole this too!

41
00:05:32,021 --> 00:05:33,818
Someone is coming!

42
00:05:36,141 --> 00:05:39,816
Soldiers! I heard that Zul
is around here! Do you know where he is?

43
00:05:40,701 --> 00:05:43,613
She was here! She hurt
this horse and she ran away.

44
00:05:43,821 --> 00:05:45,812
She set a wild boar on us!

45
00:05:45,861 --> 00:05:48,011
And maybe it was her
who stole our provisions!

46
00:05:48,061 --> 00:05:51,212
Hey, come this way!
There are Zul's footprints!

47
00:05:51,261 --> 00:05:53,821
They're definitely his! Look:
he's heading toward the forest!

48
00:05:53,861 --> 00:05:56,136
Let's chase him! We must
teach him a good lesson!

49
00:05:56,181 --> 00:05:59,537
- This way!
- Idiots! They fell for it!

50
00:06:00,461 --> 00:06:03,419
I left my footprints walking
backward all the way here!

51
00:06:04,541 --> 00:06:06,611
The more time passes the more
I am convinced that humans.

52
00:06:06,661 --> 00:06:10,017
...they are truly stupid
without a gram of brains!

53
00:06:10,101 --> 00:06:13,810
- Prince Sapphire!
- What is it, lady? I'm here!

54
00:06:14,020 --> 00:06:18,219
A message has arrived for
you! It comes from Prince Franz!

55
00:06:18,260 --> 00:06:20,491
From Prince Franz?

56
00:06:23,500 --> 00:06:26,618
"Dear Prince Sapphire, how are you?"

57
00:06:26,660 --> 00:06:31,212
Have you still not found
that girl I danced with?

58
00:06:32,540 --> 00:06:34,532
If only he knew it was me.

59
00:06:50,300 --> 00:06:52,212
How stupid you are.

60
00:07:00,820 --> 00:07:04,814
Is it possible that you can't
guess that that girl is me?

61
00:07:05,900 --> 00:07:07,414
Who's there?

62
00:07:12,220 --> 00:07:14,212
So you must be Zul!

63
00:07:14,820 --> 00:07:17,289
At your service, Princess!

64
00:07:17,340 --> 00:07:19,730
What are you
saying?! I am a Prince!

65
00:07:19,780 --> 00:07:23,694
Tell the truth: you, in reality,
are a Princess, aren't you?

66
00:07:23,740 --> 00:07:25,413
Be quiet!

67
00:07:39,060 --> 00:07:41,017
Let's chase him, Opal!

68
00:07:59,020 --> 00:08:01,410
Easy, Opal! Come down!

69
00:08:07,220 --> 00:08:09,098
You won't escape me!

70
00:08:22,580 --> 00:08:25,573
How clever! You fell
into a man-made trap!

71
00:08:25,620 --> 00:08:27,816
Goodbye, Princess!

72
00:08:28,260 --> 00:08:30,855
Damn fox! I'll catch
you, sooner or later!

73
00:08:34,180 --> 00:08:36,536
Let's see which way to go...

74
00:08:38,900 --> 00:08:42,018
This way... No, no!
Better this other way...

75
00:08:46,581 --> 00:08:49,414
How strange, I smell humans!

76
00:08:49,741 --> 00:08:51,732
And yet I don't see any

77
00:08:51,901 --> 00:08:55,018
Maybe it's my nose
that isn't working well today.

78
00:08:57,101 --> 00:08:59,331
Damn it, I'm trapped!

79
00:08:59,381 --> 00:09:02,930
But you haven't caught me yet
and I will sell my life dearly!

80
00:09:05,101 --> 00:09:10,653
A cannon! All right.
All right, then I surrender. Here!

81
00:09:10,821 --> 00:09:14,370
- Thank goodness, I caught that fox!
- Well done, Plastic!

82
00:09:16,701 --> 00:09:18,692
Dad, look what a beautiful cannon!

83
00:09:18,741 --> 00:09:21,130
Turn it the other way!
It's dangerous!

84
00:09:21,181 --> 00:09:22,899
Well done, son! You caught it!

85
00:09:23,301 --> 00:09:27,214
Plastic, you are becoming more capable
than I had hoped.

86
00:09:27,261 --> 00:09:29,013
Thanks, daddy!

87
00:09:30,381 --> 00:09:32,576
Look, dad!
Don't I look like a King?

88
00:09:32,621 --> 00:09:34,657
Yes, you really look like a King!

89
00:09:34,701 --> 00:09:37,693
That's why I can't wait
to see you sitting on the throne!

90
00:09:37,741 --> 00:09:39,891
If my plans come true,
my son,

91
00:09:39,941 --> 00:09:43,092
you will be the one, one day,
to sit on the throne of Silverland.

92
00:09:43,741 --> 00:09:46,016
Hurry up, dad!
I want to become King!

93
00:09:46,061 --> 00:09:48,450
First we must get rid
of my nephew Sapphire...

94
00:09:48,501 --> 00:09:50,492
...so that you can become King.

95
00:09:50,541 --> 00:09:53,180
I don't feel like waiting!
I want to be King!

96
00:09:53,221 --> 00:09:55,655
Stop throwing tantrums!
You'll have to wait instead!

97
00:09:55,701 --> 00:09:58,773
Meanwhile, why don't you act
like a King and kill that beast?

98
00:09:58,821 --> 00:10:00,698
Alright, dad! Who do I have to kill?

99
00:10:00,741 --> 00:10:03,016
What kind of question is that!
You have to kill that fox, don't you?

100
00:10:05,821 --> 00:10:08,494
Poor thing!
I'm sorry to have to kill it!

101
00:10:08,541 --> 00:10:12,011
Have you thought, son, that if you are
capable of killing this fox,

102
00:10:12,061 --> 00:10:15,337
you might also be able
to kill Sapphire?

103
00:10:15,381 --> 00:10:17,815
Go ahead, kill it with the bow!

104
00:10:21,621 --> 00:10:23,816
Stupid! What are you doing?

105
00:10:24,741 --> 00:10:27,016
What on earth are you doing?

106
00:10:27,061 --> 00:10:29,939
It was you, dad, who told me
to kill it with the bow!

107
00:10:29,981 --> 00:10:32,017
- And this is the bow!
- Fool!

108
00:10:32,061 --> 00:10:34,211
The bow is only used
to shoot the arrow!

109
00:10:34,661 --> 00:10:37,095
Ah, you are here, Grand
Duke! I was looking for you!

110
00:10:37,141 --> 00:10:40,372
Baron Nylon, what do you
have so important to tell me?

111
00:10:40,701 --> 00:10:43,818
I entered Sapphire's room
while he wasn't there...

112
00:10:43,861 --> 00:10:45,852
...and I found a box. This one!

113
00:10:45,901 --> 00:10:48,813
- It looks like a girl's jewelry box!
- Yes.

114
00:10:49,021 --> 00:10:52,809
It could contain the
proof that Sapphire is a girl.

115
00:10:52,861 --> 00:10:56,171
If I had the proof, I could have
Sapphire sentenced to death...

116
00:10:56,221 --> 00:10:59,054
...since he pretended to be
male to ascend the throne!

117
00:10:59,141 --> 00:11:02,213
In that case, the only claimant
would be your son Plastic,

118
00:11:02,261 --> 00:11:04,491
who could soon have
a crown.

119
00:11:04,541 --> 00:11:07,009
Come on, open it!
Let's see what's inside!

120
00:11:10,901 --> 00:11:12,812
Damn, how ugly it is!

121
00:11:13,461 --> 00:11:16,692
"Dear Mr. Petty Thief,
did you like this joke of mine?"

122
00:11:16,741 --> 00:11:19,380
Damn it!
The Prince made it!

123
00:11:21,181 --> 00:11:23,217
What the hell are you laughing at?!

124
00:11:23,341 --> 00:11:28,096
Are you interested in having proof that the
Prince is, in reality, a girl?

125
00:11:28,461 --> 00:11:30,577
Of course I'd be interested.

126
00:11:30,621 --> 00:11:33,215
Then, if you set me free,
I will provide you with this proof,

127
00:11:33,261 --> 00:11:35,377
because I know many things
that you don't know.

128
00:11:45,541 --> 00:11:48,499
Oh, no! I must look for Sapphire!
I must warn him immediately...

129
00:11:48,541 --> 00:11:50,657
...of the grave danger
that he is in!

130
00:11:52,701 --> 00:11:57,252
Sapphire! Sapphire!

131
00:11:59,181 --> 00:12:01,012
Hello, little bunny!

132
00:12:01,061 --> 00:12:04,053
By any chance have you seen around here
a girl... I mean, a boy?

133
00:12:05,221 --> 00:12:08,736
Are you saying he fell into a trap
and fell asleep in there?

134
00:12:08,781 --> 00:12:10,817
You really are
a smart little bunny!

135
00:12:12,021 --> 00:12:15,138
Sapphire! It's me: Tink!
Wake up!

136
00:12:15,181 --> 00:12:16,819
- Tink!
- Listen!

137
00:12:16,861 --> 00:12:18,931
At the camp, Zul
told Duralumin...

138
00:12:18,981 --> 00:12:21,131
...that he will give him
proof that you are a girl!

139
00:12:21,181 --> 00:12:23,490
Why would he do
something like that?

140
00:12:23,861 --> 00:12:26,534
Hold on to this! You
can climb back up!

141
00:12:30,581 --> 00:12:32,378
Thanks, Tink!

142
00:12:34,501 --> 00:12:36,253
Where is Zul?

143
00:12:36,821 --> 00:12:39,016
He's in the camp
and we have to go...

144
00:12:39,701 --> 00:12:43,614
Damn! I don't remember anymore
which direction I came from!

145
00:12:44,341 --> 00:12:48,016
At such an important moment
you go and forget the way?

146
00:12:48,141 --> 00:12:51,019
If you scold me, then
I'll remind you that a girl...

147
00:12:51,061 --> 00:12:53,177
...shouldn't go hunting!
- Shut up!

148
00:12:53,221 --> 00:12:55,655
You are a child
and you don't know anything about these things!

149
00:12:55,701 --> 00:12:58,340
Stop calling me "child"!
And then please remember...

150
00:12:58,381 --> 00:13:00,019
...that you too are still
a child!

151
00:13:00,061 --> 00:13:03,098
Besides, it's not good to go hunting
and kill poor animals!

152
00:13:05,021 --> 00:13:07,899
You're right! Let's go
in search of the camp!

153
00:13:08,261 --> 00:13:11,810
I'll come back for you! Now I must
run and I can't take you with me!

154
00:13:13,181 --> 00:13:15,854
What trouble if Sapphire's
secret is discovered...!

155
00:13:22,901 --> 00:13:26,018
I must get quickly
to the camp! Ugh!

156
00:13:26,301 --> 00:13:29,099
Mole! Mole!

157
00:13:31,341 --> 00:13:33,901
Hello! How are you, friend?
Will you do me a favor?

158
00:13:41,221 --> 00:13:44,736
So, dad, can I kill
this fox now?

159
00:13:46,301 --> 00:13:48,815
Be good and wait!
You will kill it later.

160
00:13:49,101 --> 00:13:52,218
I don't feel like waiting! First
you tell me I can kill it...

161
00:13:52,261 --> 00:13:54,491
...and then you don't let me do it!

162
00:13:54,541 --> 00:13:58,136
Be good, son! As soon as we have
proof that Sapphire is a girl,

163
00:13:58,181 --> 00:14:00,820
I will allow you to kill
this fox! Alright?

164
00:14:00,861 --> 00:14:02,419
Alright!

165
00:14:03,461 --> 00:14:06,771
Let's go! You promised to tell us
everything once you were free.

166
00:14:06,821 --> 00:14:09,096
I didn't know that men
were so impetuous!

167
00:14:09,741 --> 00:14:12,209
Alright, that means I'll take
the rest of the meal...

168
00:14:12,261 --> 00:14:15,253
...and I'll go eat it in the woods.
- But first give us proof!

169
00:14:15,421 --> 00:14:19,414
I cannot speak without having
completed a ceremony.

170
00:14:19,461 --> 00:14:21,656
A ceremony?
And what is it about?

171
00:14:21,701 --> 00:14:24,454
It's the ceremony
in which I solemnly swear..

172
00:14:24,501 --> 00:14:26,890
..that everything I will tell you
is true.

173
00:14:28,461 --> 00:14:32,659
Bring me sulfur and oak leaves
and make a pile of them.

174
00:14:32,701 --> 00:14:35,932
- Do you need all these things?
- What do you care?!

175
00:14:36,181 --> 00:14:38,570
Bring all these things right away!

176
00:14:38,621 --> 00:14:41,010
Listen, dad, can I kill her afterwards?

177
00:14:41,061 --> 00:14:42,653
Shut up!

178
00:14:50,501 --> 00:14:54,210
Now, Baron Nylon,
please, light a nice fire.

179
00:14:54,461 --> 00:14:56,691
- You want a fire?!
- I need a fire...

180
00:14:56,741 --> 00:15:00,017
for the ceremony! I must
offer a prayer to my ancestors!

181
00:15:15,821 --> 00:15:18,016
I tricked you, Grand Duke!

182
00:15:18,101 --> 00:15:20,331
The fox has run away!

183
00:15:22,021 --> 00:15:24,012
Chase it!

184
00:15:52,021 --> 00:15:54,251
Do you mean you found the fox?

185
00:15:54,581 --> 00:15:56,936
I must run to warn Sapphire!

186
00:15:57,661 --> 00:15:59,413
But that's Tink!

187
00:16:00,741 --> 00:16:02,379
Tink!

188
00:16:03,021 --> 00:16:04,818
Wait, it's me!

189
00:16:06,341 --> 00:16:08,332
A mole told me
that the fox...

190
00:16:08,381 --> 00:16:10,576
.got caught in a trap,
near the swamp!

191
00:16:11,101 --> 00:16:12,819
Down there!

192
00:16:14,061 --> 00:16:16,655
This time
I won't let you escape, Zul!

193
00:16:17,301 --> 00:16:20,896
Please, Prince, let me go!
My little ones are waiting for me

194
00:16:20,941 --> 00:16:23,330
...and if I die,
who will look after them?

195
00:16:23,581 --> 00:16:27,540
I don't believe you anymore! This time you won't
fool me with your whining!

196
00:16:27,621 --> 00:16:31,580
I don't want to die! If I die,
my little ones will die too!

197
00:16:31,621 --> 00:16:34,010
They were just born
and they've already lost their mother!

198
00:16:36,621 --> 00:16:39,374
Goodbye, my dear little ones!
I will never see you again!

199
00:16:39,421 --> 00:16:41,457
Now you are about to lose
your father too!

200
00:16:42,541 --> 00:16:45,578
Is it true, Zul?
Do you really have cubs?

201
00:16:46,261 --> 00:16:49,492
Yes, yes, it's true!
And they are cute, just like you.

202
00:16:51,301 --> 00:16:53,257
Zul, leave Tink alone!

203
00:16:53,541 --> 00:16:56,817
Now listen to me:
if you don't want me to bite your friend,

204
00:16:56,861 --> 00:16:58,817
free me from this trap!

205
00:17:00,101 --> 00:17:02,331
Come on, free me, Princess!

206
00:17:03,741 --> 00:17:06,778
I'm taking this child with me
as a hostage.

207
00:17:09,021 --> 00:17:12,855
Don't try to follow me or your
friend will meet a bad end!

208
00:17:14,021 --> 00:17:16,057
Now I'm angry!

209
00:17:16,421 --> 00:17:18,013
Let's go!

210
00:17:45,221 --> 00:17:47,018
Wait, Zul!

211
00:18:09,021 --> 00:18:12,457
You are surrounded!
Surrender, Zul! You can't escape!

212
00:18:12,741 --> 00:18:16,290
If you want, you can even kill
me, but this child will die with me!

213
00:18:17,261 --> 00:18:18,899
And what do we care?

214
00:18:19,421 --> 00:18:22,811
Yes, you understood perfectly
well! We couldn't care less...

215
00:18:22,861 --> 00:18:25,011
..whether you kill that child!

216
00:18:25,061 --> 00:18:28,371
This confirms to me that you
humans are much more evil than us!

217
00:18:32,661 --> 00:18:34,652
I can't bring myself to kill you.

218
00:18:34,701 --> 00:18:36,692
You can just go home.

219
00:18:37,901 --> 00:18:41,371
Zul, be careful! And above all
don't trust a guy like Nylon!

220
00:18:45,661 --> 00:18:48,095
With this collar,
you won't be able to run far!

221
00:18:49,021 --> 00:18:51,819
I'm not stupid.
I only run away when I can.

222
00:18:54,621 --> 00:18:56,213
It's the voice of a bear!

223
00:19:04,221 --> 00:19:06,416
Watch out, my little fox cubs!

224
00:19:28,021 --> 00:19:30,012
That bear is attacking the fox cubs!

225
00:19:31,021 --> 00:19:33,171
Quick, everyone give chase!

226
00:19:48,221 --> 00:19:50,894
Quick, Zul, run away!
The bear will kill you!

227
00:19:55,021 --> 00:19:57,819
Your violence
doesn't scare me at all, bear!

228
00:20:06,261 --> 00:20:09,219
Zul didn't tell a lie
by saying he had three cubs!

229
00:20:11,781 --> 00:20:13,817
Zul, now I will avenge you!

230
00:20:15,261 --> 00:20:18,253
I didn't know that Sapphire too
was on Zul's trail.

231
00:20:19,261 --> 00:20:21,570
Giant bear, I challenge you!

232
00:20:21,861 --> 00:20:24,136
Zul, stay and guard
the fox cubs!

233
00:20:49,581 --> 00:20:52,937
Friend mole, Sapphire is in
trouble! We must help him!

234
00:21:02,901 --> 00:21:05,290
Thank you, Zul! I will use it!

235
00:21:16,221 --> 00:21:18,894
You came to help me too,
mole! Thank you!

236
00:21:24,821 --> 00:21:28,177
Well done, Sapphire! Well done!

237
00:21:28,461 --> 00:21:30,611
Well done! Well done!

238
00:21:30,661 --> 00:21:33,414
I owe you eternal gratitude,
Prince Sapphire!

239
00:21:34,101 --> 00:21:36,171
It was magnificent!

240
00:21:38,061 --> 00:21:40,734
- Everything alright, Sapphire?
- Yes, everything's fine, Tink!

241
00:21:41,461 --> 00:21:43,816
I'm worried about that big beast.

242
00:21:44,421 --> 00:21:47,413
- I'll go check!
- You are always an angel of goodness

243
00:21:51,061 --> 00:21:53,370
You didn't get hurt too badly, did you?

244
00:21:53,421 --> 00:21:55,889
You fought very well,
Prince, but I remind you...

245
00:21:55,941 --> 00:21:58,011
...that that fox belongs
to my son Plastic,

246
00:21:58,061 --> 00:22:01,690
because he is the one who caught it!
Give it back to us immediately, please!

247
00:22:01,741 --> 00:22:03,891
How dare that schemer...?!

248
00:22:05,661 --> 00:22:09,813
I won't give Zul to anyone,
least of all to you, Grand Duke!

249
00:22:09,861 --> 00:22:13,740
He must decide for himself,
to return with us of his own free will.

250
00:22:14,901 --> 00:22:17,654
I'm sure he prefers
returning to captivity,

251
00:22:17,701 --> 00:22:20,534
rather than seeing them
kill all those little foxes.

252
00:22:23,101 --> 00:22:25,854
Zul, watch out!
It's a trap! Don't go!

253
00:22:37,021 --> 00:22:40,093
I know for sure that Prince
Sapphire, in reality, is...

254
00:22:40,141 --> 00:22:42,336
In reality,
he is definitely a boy.

255
00:22:42,381 --> 00:22:44,895
- You stupid idiot! Don't tell lies!
- Look who's talking, you big liar!

256
00:22:45,501 --> 00:22:48,334
This time I have betrayed
you! Have no mercy!

257
00:22:48,381 --> 00:22:50,736
Kill all these beasts!

258
00:22:53,501 --> 00:22:55,298
Help!

259
00:22:55,341 --> 00:22:57,013
Help!

260
00:22:58,901 --> 00:23:00,619
Quickly, let's escape!

261
00:23:00,821 --> 00:23:03,096
- Wait for me!
- Out of the way!

262
00:23:04,461 --> 00:23:07,134
Thank you, bear!
You were very kind.

263
00:23:07,901 --> 00:23:10,369
How cute
this little fox is!

264
00:23:10,581 --> 00:23:12,617
Goodbye, friends!

265
00:23:12,661 --> 00:23:14,891
It will be better if we don't meet again.

266
00:23:14,941 --> 00:23:18,092
I agree. It is better that
humans and foxes live apart.

267
00:23:18,141 --> 00:23:20,211
After all, nature wants it that way.

268
00:23:20,261 --> 00:23:22,536
You helped me
and I helped you,

269
00:23:22,581 --> 00:23:24,617
but now we must part.

270
00:23:25,341 --> 00:23:28,094
Goodbye, Prince Sapphire!

271
00:23:28,141 --> 00:23:31,178
- Goodbye, friends!
- Take care, animal friends!

272
00:23:31,221 --> 00:23:32,734
Bye!

273
00:23:37,581 --> 00:23:40,891
Prince, I heard that you
captured the golden fox.

274
00:23:40,941 --> 00:23:43,091
Yes, I had almost managed to catch it.

275
00:23:43,221 --> 00:23:46,293
How skilled you are
to have caught that fox!

276
00:23:47,021 --> 00:23:49,012
Do you mean you didn't catch it?!

277
00:23:49,061 --> 00:23:51,017
But if I catch it, I will give it to you as a gift!

278
00:23:51,061 --> 00:23:53,017
How kind you are!

279
00:24:24,821 --> 00:24:28,441
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

280
